# `ws setup`: the first-run walk. The mark, the status block, then one card per step, each ending in its hint line.
Output docs/assets/ws-setup.gif
Set Width 1240
Set Height 760
Source docs/tapes/_brand.tape

# Off camera: the demo HOME and its prompt.
Hide
Type "source ~/.bashrc && cd ~/projects/tide-tables && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "ws setup"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
# Welcome: begin.
Enter
Sleep 2s
# Plugins: move to Finance and choose it.
Down
Sleep 350ms
Down
Sleep 350ms
Space
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
# Notes: the arrow offers the Obsidian vault setup found.
Down
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
# Monthly cap.
Type "20"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
# Review: what will be written, then install.
Screenshot docs/assets/ws-setup-review.png
Enter
Sleep 4s
Sleep 3s
